na śaucaṁ nāpi cācāro
na satyaṁ teṣu vidyate\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4169,\"bb\":3667,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/7/b3667/\",\"shadow_value\":\"pravṛttim – acting properly; ca – also; nivṛttim – not acting improperly; ca – and; janāḥ – persons; na – never; viduḥ – know; āsurāḥ – of demoniac quality; na – never; śaucam – cleanliness; na – nor; api – also; ca – and; ācāraḥ – behavior; na – never; satyam – truth; teṣu – in them; vidyate – there is.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"pravṛttim\",\"translation\":\"acting properly\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"nivṛttim\",\"translation\":\"not acting improperly\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"janāḥ\",\"translation\":\"persons\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"viduḥ\",\"translation\":\"know\"},{\"word\":\"āsurāḥ\",\"translation\":\"of demoniac quality\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"śaucam\",\"translation\":\"cleanliness\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"nor\"},{\"word\":\"api\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"ācāraḥ\",\"translation\":\"behavior\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"satyam\",\"translation\":\"truth\"},{\"word\":\"teṣu\",\"translation\":\"in them\"},{\"word\":\"vidyate\",\"translation\":\"there is\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4170,\"bb\":3668,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/7/b3668/\",\"body_value\":\"Those who are demoniac do not know what is to be done and what is not to be done. Neither cleanliness nor proper behavior nor truth is found in them.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4171,\